sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator
    participant Mesh as Service Mesh<br/>(expected mTLS)
    participant Detector as regex-detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in PII Detectors<br/>(email, SSN, credit card)
    participant Custom as Custom Regex Engine

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 1: Text Content Detection

    Orchestrator->>Mesh: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>JSON: content + detector_params
    Mesh->>Detector: Forward request<br/>Plain HTTP 8080/TCP

    alt detector_params.regex is empty
        Detector-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 400 Bad Request
    else valid regex list
        Detector->>Detector: Log request payload (info level)<br/>⚠️ May contain PII

        loop Each detector_params.regex entry
            alt Built-in pattern (email/ssn/credit-card)
                Detector->>BuiltIn: Match against built-in regex
                BuiltIn-->>Detector: Matches with char offsets
            else Custom pattern
                alt Valid regex
                    Detector->>Custom: Compile and match custom regex
                    Custom-->>Detector: Matches with char offsets
                else Invalid regex
                    Detector->>Detector: Log warning, skip pattern silently
                end
            end
        end

        Detector-->>Mesh: HTTP 200 JSON response<br/>detections: [{start, end, text, detection_type, score: 1.0}]
        Mesh-->>Orchestrator: Forward response
    end

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 2: Health Check

    participant Probe as Kubernetes Probe

    Probe->>Detector: GET /health<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP
    Detector-->>Probe: HTTP 200 "healthy"
